        1960,
        1457
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "**Section 3.** The reduced-rate-of-contribution factor is two and one-half per centum with respect to those members of the Housing Police Service who elected an optional plan of retirement under the provisions of Chapter 971 of the Laws of 1964, and who were members of the New York City Employees' Retirement System under such plan immediately prior to the commencement date of the 1967-1968 increased-take-home-pay period.",
